//
// Vuillecard, Pierre et al. "CCDb-HG: Novel Annotations and Gaze-Aware
// Representations for Head Gesture Recognition", IEEE FG 2024.
// https://github.com/idiap/ccdbhg-head-gesture-recognition
//
// Extracted with torch.load(..., map_location="cpu") and pickle.load on the
// checkpoint's own tensors, printed at {:.9g} in PyTorch's native
// [out_channels][in_channels][kernel_position] order for each Conv1d (no
// bias; bias=false in config.yaml), and [out][in] for the Linear head.
// train_stats.pkl's "mean" is None for this checkpoint (transform_abs_rel:
// rel forces mean_method to "none"); only "std" (per channel, 18 values) is
// used.

